<page>
  <notes>Construction tree for z=10110110101. The blue suffix factorization is z[1..]=y_1 y_2 with y_1=01 and y_2=10110101. The red prefix factorization is z[..-1]=z_4 z_3 z_2 z_1 with z_4=z_3=z_2=101 and z_1=0. The fourth panel shows the odd-length suffix z[2..]=110110101=y prime_1 s, with y prime_1=1101 in Y and s=10101 in Z.</notes>
